{"lesson_uid":"L0005","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":249,"chars":5694,"poly_positions":1753,"he_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":1,"text":"下班時刻，262路公車上有點擠。一位國中女生從前門上車，站在司機旁，搖搖晃晃的，臉色慘白，好像隨時會昏倒的樣子。","n":56,"ssz":"................1..................................1..1."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":2,"text":"司機發現後，對她說：「你不舒服就去坐博愛座！」女生點了個頭表示感謝，走到唯一空著的博愛座坐下。","n":47,"ssz":"...........................1..................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":3,"text":"隔了兩站，一位大媽提著大包小包上車，她一看到博愛座上的女生，立刻板起臉，嚷道：「誰家小孩這麼沒教養，連博愛座都敢坐，全車都站著，你憑什麼坐著？」","n":72,"ssz":".....1.................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":4,"text":"司機聽到連忙解釋：「這位同學身體不舒服，是我讓她去坐的。」","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":5,"text":"大媽眉毛一挑：「我都沒得坐，小孩子裝個病，就有博愛座？真了不起！」","n":33,"ssz":"....2......1....1...........1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":6,"text":"女生都快哭出來了，勉強要站起來。旁邊一位阿姨，伸手按在她肩膀上，一邊搖頭一邊以眼神示意，要女學生不必起身，柔聲說道：「博愛座是給需要的人坐的。」","n":72,"ssz":"..........1.......1.............2...2...........1......................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":7,"text":"大媽不甘示弱，提高音量：「唷，好有正義感呀。公車上互不相識，你怎麼知道誰有需要？她有需要，我就沒需要？」乘客開始側目、低聲議論。","n":64,"ssz":"...........................1...................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":8,"text":"「幹嘛呀，都幾歲了，還這樣講話？真了不起！」人群裡突然有人路見不平，大聲的說，公車裡漸漸有了火藥味。","n":50,"ssz":".................1................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":9,"text":"大媽更大聲回道：「現在是怎麼了，我說個話也不行了嗎？」","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":10,"text":"這時廣播裡傳出司機的聲音：「這位小姐，請控制自己的音量，任何人若再干擾到其他乘客，我都會請他下車。」","n":50,"ssz":".................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":11,"text":"大媽尖聲嚷了起來：「干擾？干擾什麼？你這話是說我嗎？我要去投訴你這個不講理、不守規矩的……」","n":46,"ssz":".................................1............"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":12,"text":"眼看局面就要不可收拾，國中女生隔壁一位頭髮斑白的老奶奶再也看不下去了，她伸出滿是皺紋的手，摸了摸女生的額頭，轉頭看著大媽說：「這位太太，年輕人真的生病了，你怎麼還強逼人家讓座？你需要座位，我讓位給你好了。」她一邊說一邊顫顫巍巍的站了起來。","n":119,"ssz":".................1........1...1...................................1.....................................2..2..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":13,"text":"大媽尷尬了，臉一下子漲得通紅，連忙擺手說：「您坐，您坐，我馬上到站了。」車子一停，大媽提著大包小包一溜煙的下了車。老奶奶再緩緩坐下時，全車爆出一陣掌聲。","n":76,"ssz":".......1.1.1.........................12..........2.........1...........1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"aaymn","idx":14,"text":"這時司機的廣播傳來：「謝謝阿嬤，謝謝大家，今天真是個美好的一天。」","n":33,"ssz":"............1....1.......1......."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"hkx6e","idx":null,"text":"下班時刻，262路公車上有點擠。一位國中女生從前門上車，站在司機旁，搖搖晃晃的，臉色慘白，好像隨時會昏倒的樣子。司機發現後，對她說：「你不舒服就去坐博愛座！」女生點了個頭表示感謝，走到唯一空著的博愛座坐下。隔了兩站，一位大媽提著大包小包上車，她一看到博愛座上的女生，立刻板起臉，嚷道：「誰家小孩這麼沒教養，連博愛座都敢坐，全車都站著，你憑什麼坐著？」司機聽到連忙解釋：「這位同學身體不舒服，是我讓她去坐的。」大媽眉毛一挑：「我都沒得坐，小孩子裝個病，就有博愛座？真了不起！」女生都快哭出來了，勉強要站起來。旁邊一位阿姨，伸手按在她肩膀上，一邊搖頭一邊以眼神示意，要女學生不必起身，柔聲說道：「博愛座是給需要的人坐的。」大媽不甘示弱，提高音量：「唷，好有正義感呀。公車上互不相識，你怎麼知道誰有需要？她有需要，我就沒需要？」乘客開始側目、低聲議論。","n":373,"ssz":"................1..................................1..1............................1........................1...................................................................................................2......1....1...........1..............1.......1.............2...2...........1..................................................1...................................."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"美好的一天","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"記敘文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論策略──推論情緒和感受","n":13,"ssz":"..........1.."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是「當別人說話或做事時，想想他心裡在想什麼、有什麼感覺」，就像這篇文章裡，那位身體不舒服的女生，還有生氣的大媽，你都可以試著想想他們為什麼會那樣做，還有當時心裡有多難過或生氣，讀的時候，可以把他們說的話和做的事，跟他們身體的狀況或當時的氣氛連在一起想，就能更了解他們囉","n":143,"ssz":".1.........................................................................1..................................1....................2......1...."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章描述了一段在公車上發生的故事。一位身體不適的國中女生在博愛座上休息，卻被一位大媽誤解並責備。在爭執中，有其他乘客和司機介入，試圖化解僵局。故事探討了在公共場合，人們如何看待和對待「需要幫助」的他人，以及在面對誤解與衝突時，不同的反應會帶來什麼樣的結果。","n":130,"ssz":".......1...........1...1................1...................1.............................1............................1.........."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論策略—推論情緒和感受","n":12,"ssz":".........1.."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞書寫練習","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"示意","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用動作、眼神等方式讓別人知道自己的意思。","n":20,"ssz":"..................2."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"局面","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"事情進行到某一階段時，出現的整體情況或狀態。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"火藥味","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比喻氣氛緊張，好像快要吵起來或發生衝突。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一溜煙","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形容動作非常快，像煙一樣迅速不見。","n":17,"ssz":"..........1...1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尷尬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓人不好意思，不知道該怎麼辦。","n":15,"ssz":".....2........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"顫顫巍巍","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形容人因老弱、害怕或不舒服，動作不穩、發抖的樣子。","n":25,"ssz":".......................1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不可收拾","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"事情變得很嚴重、很混亂，已經沒辦法解決或控制。","n":23,"ssz":"...1..................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"側目","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"斜著眼睛看人，通常表示驚訝、不滿、或看不慣。","n":22,"ssz":".4.................1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"路見不平","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到不公正或不合理的事情，挺身而出，打抱不平。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師用眼神向我（　）要我站起來回答問題，我趕緊從座位上站起來。","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下課鐘一響，學生們（　）跑出教室，衝向福利社買點心。","n":26,"ssz":"...2......................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他在網路上亂留言，如果不及早處理，後果恐怕（　）。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他看不慣班上霸凌的行為，所以（　），出面說了幾句公道話。","n":28,"ssz":"..1........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他在火車上大聲講電話，引來大家（　）。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他剛生完大病，走路時還是（　），需要人扶著。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"serve