":"..1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[5].clue","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"臉紅、連忙擺手說：「…我馬上到站了。」","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尷尬、丟臉、自覺理虧","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還在生氣、不想理會","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[6].event","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"車子一停","n":4,"ssz":".12."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[6].clue","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提著大包小包一溜煙下車","n":11,"ssz":"......2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[6].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"慚愧或丟臉、急著離開現場","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[6].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假裝什麼也沒發生","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、推論主旨或目的","n":9,"ssz":"........2"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從大媽的說話、語氣、動作，我們可以看到她一開始因誤會而「生氣」，後來在老奶奶提醒後，轉為「尷尬」與「慚愧」。最後，讓我們來想想，透過大媽的轉變，這個故事想要告訴我們什麼？（請在□打勾，複選）","n":95,"ssz":"....................2................1...................................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人會因為理解而改變態度","n":11,"ssz":"...1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"發脾氣是解決問題的最好方法","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"善意可以化解衝突、消除誤會","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不用了解情況，吃虧時就應該生氣","n":15,"ssz":"1.1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四、換你試試看，推論其他角色的情緒或感受","n":20,"ssz":"............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.段六：女生都快哭出來了，勉強要站起來。女生當時最可能的情緒是什麼？","n":35,"ssz":"...............1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].items[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"害怕、委屈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.段八：人群聲音：「幹嘛呀，都幾歲了，還這樣講話？真了不起！」講這句話的人，最可能的情緒是什麼？","n":49,"ssz":"...........................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].items[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"忿忿不平／不屑","n":7,"ssz":".....1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎自我檢核","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、請你自己檢查以下3項，確定自己是否會推論情緒和感受了","n":28,"ssz":"........................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我會根據人物說的話、語氣、表情、動作，推測情緒或感受。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我會思考人物說的話是不是真心話，推測他隱藏的真正情緒。","n":27,"ssz":"..........1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我能把故事前後線索連起來，推論大媽情緒的變化，並明白故事想傳達的道理。","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].closing","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、如果三項都打勾，恭喜你，你已經學會推論人物的情緒和感受，這對你理解文章和人際互動，都有很大的幫助哦。你超厲害的！","n":58,"ssz":"..........................1..........1...................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"事件起點","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一位女生上了公車，臉色慘白，司機請她去【　】","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"坐博愛座","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].lab